exports[`HookEndpointUsageGuide DOM unchanged by extraction > open 1`] = `
"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[80] flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-dark-950/40 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all animate-in fade-in duration-300"><div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col max-h-[85vh] animate-in slide-in-from-bottom-8"><div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-50/50"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="p-2.5 bg-primary-500 rounded-xl text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary-500/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Custom Endpoints Usage Guide</h3></div><button type="button" class="p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div><div class="p-8 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar prose prose-slate max-w-none"><div class="space-y-8"><section><h4 class="text-primary-600 flex items-center gap-2 font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg> Introduction</h4><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">ใช้สำหรับเชื่อมต่อ API ของคุณเองแบบ Custom โดยระบบจะส่งข้อมูล <b>Line User ID</b> ไปให้คุณเพื่อดึงข้อมูลหรือทำรายการต่าง ๆ</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 italic bg-primary-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-primary-500/10 not-italic"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info text-primary-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider">คู่มือการใช้งาน</span></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-bold">ตั้งค่า API ของคุณเพื่อใช้งาน Dynamic Ext. Endpoint และดึงข้อมูลจากระบบภายนอกอัตโนมัติ (ศึกษาเพิ่มเติมจากคลิปตัวอย่าง)</p></div><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/EXAMPLE_FILE_ID/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="flex-shrink-0 w-full sm:w-[150px] aspect-video rounded-xl relative overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer border-2 border-primary-500/30 bg-dark-900 shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary-500/40 transition-all active:scale-95 animate-pulse-slow"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-600/20 to-dark-950 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-red-600 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center border border-white/20 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-red-500 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl shadow-red-500/30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play text-white fill-white ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="absolute top-2 left-2 flex items-center gap-1.5"><div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></div><span class="text-[9px] font-black text-white/70 uppercase tracking-widest">Engineer Guide</span></div><div class="absolute bottom-2 right-2 flex items-center gap-1 bg-dark-950/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-monitor text-primary-400" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"></line></svg><span class="text-[10px] font-black text-white uppercase tabular-nums">คลิป</span></div></a></div></section><section class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><h4 class="text-slate-800 font-bold mb-3">Endpoint Key</h4><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">ชื่อเรียกของ API นี้ (แนะนำภาษาอังกฤษตัวพิมพ์ใหญ่) เช่น:</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 font-mono text-xs text-primary-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">CUSTOMER_PROFILE</div><div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 font-mono text-xs text-primary-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">PAYMENT_HISTORY</div></div></section><section><h4 class="text-slate-800 font-bold mb-3">Dynamic Values</h4><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">คุณสามารถใช้ตัวแปรเหล่านี้ใน Path หรือ Request Body:</p><ul class="space-y-3 m-0 p-0 list-none"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-emerald-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100"><code class="text-emerald-700 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 font-bold text-xs">{{line_user_id}}</code><span class="text-xs text-emerald-800 font-medium">ใช้ใน <b>Path</b> เพื่อระบุ ID ผู้ส่ง</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-blue-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-blue-100"><code class="text-blue-700 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue-200 font-bold text-xs">{{lineuserid}}</code><span class="text-xs text-blue-800 font-medium">ใช้ใน <b>Request Body</b> (JSON Value)</span></li></ul></section><section class="bg-dark-900 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-dark-700 shadow-inner"><h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal text-primary-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19h8"></path><path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6"></path></svg>Example JSON Payload</h4><pre class="m-0 bg-transparent text-primary-400 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed">{
  "userid": "{{lineuserid}}",
  "action": "check_balance",
  "timestamp": "2024-04-12"
}</pre></section></div></div><div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100 flex justify-end"><button type="button" class="px-8 py-3 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl font-bold transition-all shadow-lg active:scale-95 text-sm">Get Started</button></div></div></div>"
